    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The annual Postgraduate Medical Education (PGME) conference provides residents, trainees and interns with opportunities to learn from the industry's best minds and practitioners. This year's theme for the conference was Tawazun (balance) and saw experts discuss how to successfully juggle professional commitments with personal life.",
